{"articleNo":"2347","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2347&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009 겨울계절수업 타대학(경대) 수학신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.10.28","hit":"14676","attachments":[{"name":"타대학수학신청원(2009).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2347&attachNo=1895"},{"name":"2009 경북대 겨울계절 타교생 수학안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2347&attachNo=2017"},{"name":"2009학년도 학부(과)선수과목표 200907.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2347&attachNo=2034"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"4\">2009학년도 경북대 여름계절수업 수강안내를&nbsp;<br><br>아래와 같이 알려드립니다.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◈ 신청지원자격(다음 각 호의 요건에 모두 해당하는 자)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<font size=\"3\">가. 2009학년도 2학기 현재 본교 재학생</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 2개 학기 이상 이수자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 이수성적 평점평균이 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3.0</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 이상인 자</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 라. 학칙에 의하여 징계받은 사실이 없는 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◈ 수신청방법</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> :&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수학신청원 제출 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; →&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0066ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">각 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◈ 신청마감일&nbsp; :&nbsp; 2009. 11. 02(월)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 타대학 수학 신청시 유의사항</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 1. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">본교 성적인정 교과목을 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">각 종합학사행정실 및 교양교직원에서 필히 확인하여 작성</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 2. 선수과목이 필요한 과목을 신청할 경우 선수과목 이수여부를 확인한 후 신청 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞ 각 학부(전공)별 선수과목 : 첨부파일 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 3.<font color=\"#ff0000\"> \"</font></span><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">8학기차졸업예정자\" 및 \"2010-1학기 타대학 편입학 예정자\"들은 타대학수학신청 불가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">학적부 사진 미제출자는 수강신청 불가<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#800080\" size=\"3\"><strong>.-&gt;&nbsp; 기타 자세한 내용은 첨부 안내문을 참고하시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;<br><br><br><br><br></strong></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
